leaf (the amount we would need to consume from that leaf\'s stock + substitutes). Then available = leaf own stock + available from substitutes.\n        \n        pass  # placeholder for now; we\'ll implement properly\n    \n    results.append({\n        \'order_id\': oid,\n        \'allocated_qty\': max_k,\n        \'shortfall_qty\': shortfall,\n        \'limiting_resource\': limiting\n    })\n\n# Sort results by order_id ascending\nresults.sort(key=lambda x: x[\'order_id\'])\n\nwith open(\'/app/report.json\', \'w\') as f:\n    json.dump({\'orders\': results}, f, indent=2)\n\nprint("Done")\nfor r in results:\n    print(r)\nPYEOF\necho "Script written. Now running..."\npython3 /app/solve.py\n'] min_timeout_sec: 0.5 max_timeout_sec: 180.0
